 we we must fight there is no  other option as long as the taliban are  fighting  against us and they it looks like they  will then we don't have any other option  the general told us american troops have  already started pulling back from bases  in the south and the east that's where  the taliban are at their strongest  as for whether afghan forces will be  ready to hold their own  the top american general here says  they'll have to be  gail right charlie dagetta reporting  from kabul thank you
 

